<title>TURKEY: Turkish 273-d t-bill yield falls to 136.32 pct.</title>
<headline>Turkish 273-d t-bill yield falls to 136.32 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Turkish Treasury's 273-day t-bill yield fell to 136.32 percent on Tuesday, down 8.6 points from the previous 182-day -bill auction on November 19.</p>
<p>	Maturity		    : Sept 3, 1997</p>
<p>	Amount			: 100.0 trln lira</p>
<p>	Coupon			: -</p>
